<urn:atm:triage:finding/RSH-004>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "RSH-004" ;
  triage:title "No envelope_json size limit before INSERT" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-rusqlite/src/writer/ops.rs — No upper bound on envelope_json serialized size before entering the write queue. T2 introduced MAX_ENVELOPE_JSON_BYTES guard via validate_upsert_message_request; T3 diverged (immutable-rows refactor) and the guard is absent on T3 and above." ;
